  "question": {
    "text": "The molar conductances of $\\mathrm{Ba}(\\mathrm{OH})_2, \\mathrm{BaCl}_2$ and $\\mathrm{NH}_4 \\mathrm{Cl}$ at infinite dilution are $523.28,280.0$ and $129.8 \\mathrm{~S} \\mathrm{~cm}^2 \\mathrm{~mol}^{-1}$ respectively. The molar conductance of $\\mathrm{NH}_4 \\mathrm{OH}$ at infinite dilution will be",
    "image": null
